<poml>
  <meta>
    <id>extended_parity.plan</id>
    <version>0.1.0</version>
    <owner>poml-go-sdk</owner>
  </meta>
  <role>Achieve Extended proposal parity with opt-in gating and ExtendedOff compatibility.</role>

  <task caption="Schema/enums (highest)">
    <list>
      <item>Finalize MIME/kind enums per proposal: images (png/jpeg/webp/svg/tiff/heic/avif), audio (flac/ogg/opus/aac/mp4), video (mp4/webm/quicktime/mpeg/matroska/avi/m4v/3gpp), data (json/xml/octet-stream). Extend allowlists to include proposal-specific media/data kinds; keep CLI/env/POML allowlist knobs.</item>
      <item>Objects/data blocks: enforce syntax/data requirements and allowed kinds (json/xml/octet-stream) in strict mode.</item>
      <item>Ops: enforce allowed kinds (builtin/custom/tool/function) with allowlist override; ensure args JSON, name required.</item>
      <item>Figures/media: enforce alt/syntax/size; allow data/body with inferred syntax only when data URI provides it; width/height numeric.</item>
      <item>Build ExtendedOff regression fixtures ensuring defaults reject Extended elements unless mode="extended" or flag.</item>
    </list>
  </task>

  <task caption="Parsing/rendering">
    <list>
      <item>Add parser/render tests for remaining Extended elements (custom media/data blocks) and unknown-attr rejection toggle.</item>
      <item>Extend lossless corpus with Extended-on and Extended-off cases covering new elements and mixed text.</item>
    </list>
  </task>

  <task caption="Converters">
    <list>
      <item>Emit Extended data/media/ops across dict/OpenAI/LangChain; ensure ExtendedOff drops/flags appropriately.</item>
      <item>Add converter goldens for ExtendedOn/Off for new tags (data/object/media variants) and op kinds.</item>
    </list>
  </task>

  <task caption="Validation goldens">
    <list>
      <item>Add strict invalid fixtures: bad mime/kind, missing syntax/alt, oversize media, bad width/height, bad op args JSON, unknown attrs when reject-unknown on.</item>
      <item>Add lenient fixtures: Extended lenient accepts unknown attrs but still requires core mandatory fields.</item>
    </list>
  </task>

  <task caption="Mixed text/segmentation">
    <list>
      <item>Expand segmentation tests for inline tags, escapes, and embedded-tag extraction to match proposal guidance.</item>
      <item>Add goldens for text-escape + media inline cases.</item>
    </list>
  </task>

  <task caption="Docs/CLI">
    <list>
      <item>Document Extended enablement (mode=\"extended\", flags), allowlist knobs, and new enums/tags with examples.</item>
      <item>Update roadmap status and README/build docs once the above land.</item>
    </list>
  </task>

  <output-format>Keep each task tied to fixtures/tests; mark completion in this file.</output-format>
</poml>
